<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2011/08/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata minClientVersion="2.12">
    <id>MimeKit.Core</id>
    <version>5.0.0</version>
    <title>MimeKit.Core</title>
    <authors>Jeffrey Stedfast</authors>
    <owners>Jeffrey Stedfast</owners>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <projectUrl>https://www.mimekit.net</projectUrl>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/jstedfast/MimeKit" />
    <icon>icons\mimekit-50.png</icon>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>
      MimeKit is an Open Source library for creating and parsing MIME messages. It also supports parsing of Unix mbox files.

      MimeKit.Core provides the core MIME creation and parsing functionality without any dependency on BouncyCastle. For OpenPGP, S/MIME and DKIM/ARC support, add the MimeKit.Cryptography package (or the MimeKit meta-package).

      API documentation can be found on the web at http://www.mimekit.net/docs

      For those that need SMTP, POP3 or IMAP support, check out https://github.com/jstedfast/MailKit
    </description>
    <summary>An Open Source library for creating and parsing MIME messages.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>
* Split MimeKit into MimeKit.Core (this package) and MimeKit.Cryptography. MimeKit.Core replaces the deprecated MimeKitLite package.
    </releaseNotes>
    <copyright>.NET Foundation and Contributors</copyright>
    <language>en-US</language>
    <tags>mime mbox mail email parser tnef</tags>
    <readme>docs\README.md</readme>
